# Turek-Hron FSI3 with the benchmark's reference parameters only (Turek & Hron 2006).
# Preset fsi3: U_mean 2.0 m/s (Re 200), rho_s = rho_f = 1000 kg/m^3, E 5.6 MPa, nu 0.4, mu_f 1 Pa s,
# 2 s cosine inlet ramp.  Periodic state: fit the oscillation of point A, drag and lift.
# usage: python -B run_turek_hron_fsi.py @configs/fsi3.args --output DIR [--arch cuda]
--preset fsi3
--kappa-over-mu 4.666666666666667   # 2 (1 + nu) / (3 (1 - 2 nu)) for nu = 0.4
--ib-kernel ib4                     # IB_4 regularized delta
--grid 4,96,576                     # quasi-2-D: 4 span cells, h = 0.41 m / 96
--end-time 10.0
--row-interval 10
